   "layer": "regulation",
   "reason": "The letter raises the maximum wage used as the base for Jaminan Pensiun contributions from Rp 9.559.600 to Rp 10.042.300 for 2024. The employee's JP contribution (1% of capped wage) is a deduction when computing PPh 21 net income for permanent employees. A higher cap therefore changes the deductible amount for employees earning above the old cap.",
